# Contexto = raíz del monorepo (docker build -f apps/api/Dockerfile .)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
*.AppImage
*.flatpakrepo
apps/api/uploads
apps/api/src/generated
apps/api/**/__tests__
# De web y mobile solo se necesita el package.json (el lockfile los incluye)
apps/web/*
!apps/web/package.json
apps/mobile/*
!apps/mobile/package.json
